Subject: [PATCH 25/26] feat: viewfinder overlays - frame guides and focus
 peaking in the final composite

Frame guides (rule of thirds, centre cross, action/title safe areas, aspect framing guide with shaded outside) drawn in viewport space, and focus peaking (luminance edge response inside the thin-lens depth of field, tinted) sampled through the same remapped coordinate as the picture, both at the end of the PostAA composite after grain and sharpening. Eight r_Lens* cvars pushed by the new Viewfinder component group; r_LensOverlays is the recording kill switch and the component only enables overlays in the editor unless Overlays In Game Mode is set. With overlays off the composite is bit-for-bit unchanged. Reviewed by the main session; user verification pending.

